url": "https://api.fia.com/news/rwanda-mountain-gorilla-rally-2025-preview-0"}, {"date": null, "snippet": "[WEB_EXCERPT_REMOVED]", "summary": "[WEB_EXCERPT_REMOVED]", "title": "DBpedia 2014 | DBpedia", "url": "https://fragments.dbpedia.org/2014/en?object=%22The%20Rwanda%20Mountain%20Gorilla%20Rally%2C%20known%20originally%20as%20the%20Fraternity%20Rally%20is%20an%20international%20rally%20racing%20event%20organised%20by%20the%20Rwanda%20Automobile%20Club.%20The%20rally%20is%20based%20in%20the%20Rwandan%20capital%20of%20Kigali.%20The%20event%20is%20presently%20a%20round%20of%20the%20African%20Rally%20Championship%20and%20the%20Rwandan%20National%20Rally%20Championship.The%20Fraternity%20Rally%20was%20first%20run%20in%201999%20as%20motorsport%20re-established%20itself%20after%20the%20Rwandan%20Civil%20War.%20It%20began%20as%20a%20cross-border%20rally%20that%20began%20in%20Kampala%2C%20Uganda%20before%20finishing%20in%20Kigali.%20The%20rally%20became%20part%20of%20the%20African%20championship%20the%20following%20year%2C%20restoring%20a%20Rwandan%20presence%20to%20the%20African%20championship%20absent%20since%201988.%20Over%20time%20the%20Ugandan%20portion%20of%20the%20event%20faded%20and%20the%20rally%20was%20renamed%20the%20Rwanda%20Mountain%20Gorilla%20Rally%202002.Burundi%20driver%20Rudy%20Cantanhede%20is%20the%20most%20successful%20driver%20in%20the%20rallies%20history%20with%20three%20wins%20to%20his%20credit.%20Italian%20born%20local%20driver%20Giancarlo%20Davite%20has%20two%20wins%20to%20his%20credit.%20All%20bar%20two%20events%20have%20been%20won%20by%20drivers%20of%20Subaru%20Imprezas.%22%40en"}, {"date": null, "snippet": "[WEB_EXCERPT_REMOVED]", "summary": "[WEB_EXCERPT_REMOVED]", "title": "KCB Rwanda Mountain Gorilla Rally 2011    Rally Guide", "url": "http://www.africanrallychampionship.com/2011/rwanda-FINAL_RMGR-2011-RALLY-GUIDE.pdf#3#1"}, {"date": "2026-07-10T16:00:00+00:00", "snippet": "[WEB_EXCERPT_REMOVED]", "summary": "[WEB_EXCERPT_REMOVED]", "title":